1016/S0022-5347(05)67355-7</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Silva</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Ribeiro</surname><given-names>MI</given-names></name><name><surname>Cruz</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The effect of intravesical resiniferatoxin in patients with idiopathic detrusor instability suggests that involuntary detrusor contractions are triggered by C-fiber input</article-title><source>J Urol</source><year>2002</year><volume>168</volume><fpage>575</fpage><lpage>580</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12131313</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0022-5347(05)64683-6</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>